Open Construction Equipment — license scope

Original materials in this repository are made available under the following licenses:

- Software source and executable tooling: Apache License 2.0 (Apache-2.0).
  See LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt.
- Hardware designs and design data, including OpenSCAD: CERN Open Hardware
  Licence Version 2, Strongly Reciprocal (CERN-OHL-S-2.0).
  See LICENSES/CERN-OHL-S-2.0.txt.
- Original documentation and media (Markdown, prose sheets, and generated
  documentation artwork): Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0
  International (CC-BY-SA-4.0). See LICENSES/CC-BY-SA-4.0.txt.

Structured hardware registers (CSV/JSON design data) follow the hardware
license unless a file explicitly states otherwise. A file-level SPDX
identifier takes precedence when a contribution legitimately uses a
compatible different license. The included Python/C++ host-reference software
is simulation-only and non-certified; its inclusion is not a machine release.

License notices must be retained. Hardware recipients should consult the
full CERN-OHL-S-2.0 source, product, notice, and reciprocal-source duties;
this summary is not a substitute for it. Documentation adaptations must
retain attribution, indicate changes, and use CC-BY-SA-4.0 as required.

Third-party standards, manufacturer documentation, publications, license
texts, and other identified external material are not relicensed by this
project. No license grants permission to violate law, bypass competent
review, make conformity claims, or represent this concept as validated.
No physical warranty or operational suitability is offered.
